OL,3,AThe one thing the chancellor didn't
OL,4,Amention that will affect your pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FIncome tax thresholds, which have been
OL,7,Ffrozen under successive chancellors,
OL,8,Fare expected to start to rise again
OL,9,Fafter 2031.
OL,11,FJohn Healey may not have mentioned this
OL,12,Fchange in his Budget speech - after
OL,13,Fall, it is still some way off - but
OL,14,Faccording to the documents released by
OL,15,Fthe Office for Budget Responsibility
OL,16,F(OBR) this policy, which has been
OL,17,Fshaving additional tax off people's
OL,18,Ftake-home pay for the past five years,
OL,19,Fis scheduled to end.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
