OL,3,AThe one thing the chancellor didn't
OL,4,Amention that will affect your pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proportion of your income that is
OL,7,Ftaken in tax will continue to go up
OL,8,Fover the next four years in line with
OL,9,Fdecisions made in previous Budgets.
OL,11,FBut then the personal allowance - the
OL,12,Fpoint at which you start to pay tax -
OL,13,Fand other thresholds, where you tip
OL,14,Finto paying a higher rate of tax, will
OL,15,Frise again with inflation, meaning you
OL,16,Fkeep more of what you earn.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
